   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Roof reconstruction Rekon&#x161;trukcia strechy Novinovo-vydavate&#x13e;sk&#xe1; ustanovize&#x148; Hlas &#x13e;udu</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The purpose is the reconstruction of the roof, with the aim of saving on energy and ensuring decent working conditions for the employees of NVU Hlas ludu and preventing further ruination of this precious building.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SK">&lt;p&gt;&#xda;&#x10d;elom je rekon&#x161;trukcia strechy, s cie&#x13e;om uspori&#x165; na energi&#xe1;ch a zabezpe&#x10d;i&#x165; pre pracovn&#xed;kov NVU Hlas &#x13e;udu podmienky pr&#xe1;ce d&#xf4;stojn&#xe9; &#x10d;loveka a zabr&#xe1;ni&#x165; &#x10f;al&#x161;iemu ruinovaniu tohto vz&#xe1;cn&#xe9;ho objektu.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
